L['about']['body'] = '''<p>amalficoastboatguide.com is a small independent site. We are not a tour operator and we do not own boats. We put this together because booking a boat day here is more confusing than it should be: the same trip is sold under dozens of names at very different prices.</p>
<h2>What we score</h2>
<p>Listings change every week, so we do not score them one by one. We score the eight kinds of trip that actually exist on the Amalfi Coast and around Capri, looking at the route, what is usually included, typical group size and the prices we see across many listings. Each kind gets a mark out of 10 on five criteria, and a fixed weighting turns those into one score.</p>
<h2>Reviews</h2>
<p>We do not write or invent customer reviews. Customer ratings on this site come only from GetYourGuide's live listings, which are tied to real bookings.</p>
<h2>Money</h2>
<p>Some links are affiliate links to GetYourGuide and Viator. If you book through them we may earn a commission and you pay the same price. That does not change our scores. Photos come from Unsplash or from our partners' widgets.</p>
<h2>Something wrong?</h2>
<p>Prices and rules here change every season. If you spot something out of date, send us a WhatsApp and we will correct it.</p>'''
